# head/adult/paint_stripes: war stripes: two bars of red ochre under each eye (the mouth's red, derived from the skin)
# P2b FACES (wave 2). Inside A3's fixed face rows, so they fit every head type. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult youth
role paint stripes
layer face
anchor head
keys rest
z 2
tags overlay mirror-ok

view D key rest origin -4 -12
|MM....MM

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -9 -11
|MM
|..

view L key rest origin -5 -11
|MM
